<title>USA: Arden Group completes self tender.</title>
<headline>Arden Group completes self tender.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arden Group Inc Friday said it has completed its self tender offer for 250,000 Class A common shares at a price of $65 per share.</p>
<p>Based upon a preliminary count, approximately 212,600 shares were properly tendered, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Of the total, approximately 143,000 shares were tendered by City National Bank as trustee under the company's stock bonus plan.</p>
